===Death of Princess Zhivalka===
{{Main|Death of Princess Zhivalka}}

The [[death of Princess Zhivalka]] in early 2329 resulted in several safety regulations promulgated into law by her father, [[Bacha XV of Qym|King Bacha XV]], notably this and that. U/C

===Boreal War===
Production slowed down from 2329 to 2334 with government restrictions to support the war effort. It completely shut down civilian vehicle production in 2334 as the country entered a state of total war. This would last until victory in 2340. U/C

